        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"You are an expert customer support manager for South African businesses. Analyse the customer message.\\n\\n1. CATEGORY: Complaint / Question / Refund / Compliment / Other.\\n2. URGENCY: High = angry, refund, order not received, damaged, threat to leave bad review (SLA 2 hours). Medium = general complaint, delivery delay, missing info (SLA 24 hours). Low = question, compliment, general inquiry (SLA 48 hours).\\n3. SENTIMENT: Positive / Neutral / Negative / Furious.\\n4. DRAFT REPLY: Address by first name. Acknowledge specific issue, never generic. Apologise sincerely if complaint or refund. Direct answer for questions. Warm thanks for compliments. Under 80 words. South African English. Plain text.\\n5. RECOMMENDED ACTION: One concrete next step.\\n6. ESCALATE: true if Furious sentiment OR refund over R5000 OR threatens public review OR mentions legal/lawyer/CCMA. Otherwise false.\\n\\nRespond ONLY with a valid JSON object in this exact format with no markdown and no extra text: {\\\"category\\\": \\\"Complaint\\\", \\\"urgency\\\": \\\"High\\\", \\\"sentiment\\\": \\\"Negative\\\", \\\"draft_reply\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"recommended_action\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"escalate\\\": false, \\\"resolution_time\\\": \\\"2 hours\\\"}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Customer Name: {{ $json['body']['fullName'] ?? $json['body']['data']['fields'].find(f => f['label'] === 'Full Name')?.['value'] ?? 'Unknown' }}\\nEmail: {{ $json['body']['email'] ?? $json['body']['data']['fields'].find(f => f['label'] === 'Email')?.['value'] ?? 'unknown@email.com' }}\\nOrder Number: {{ $json['body']['orderNumber'] ?? $json['body']['data']['fields'].find(f => f['label'] === 'Order Number')?.['value'] ?? 'N/A' }}\\nIssue Type: {{ $json['body']['issueType'] ?? $json['body']['data']['fields'].find(f => f['label'] === 'Issue Type')?.['value'] ?? 'N/A' }}\\nMessage: {{ $json['body']['issueDescription'] ?? $json['body']['data']['fields'].find(f => f['label'] === 'Issue Description')?.['value'] ?? '' }}\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"temperature\": 0.4,\n  \"max_tokens\": 600\n}",
        "options": {}
